  "chat.this_session_should_tidy_its": { zh: "本会话预计在 {n} tokens 左右自动整理上下文。", en: "This session should tidy its context automatically at around {n} tokens." },
  "chat.this_setting_loosens_what_the": { zh: "这项设置会放宽模型的权限，所以没有「本会话内不再问」，每次都要你亲自确认。", en: "This setting loosens what the model may do, so there is no \"don't ask again this session\": you confirm it yourself each time." },
  "chat.this_source_declares_no_context": { zh: "该来源未声明上下文窗口，因此不会自动整理上下文。请先在右侧「上下文」中填写该模型的窗口大小。", en: "This source declares no context window, so nothing is tidied automatically. Declare this model's window in the Context panel on the right first." },
  "chat.this_step_takes_the_pointer": { zh: "这一步会接管你正在用的鼠标指针——移动它、用它点击，并把那个应用切到前台，而不是让界面元素自己动作。自动放行、该应用已有的授权和宽泛规则都不能代你回答；要么批准，要么切到全部放行。用完指针会回到原处。", en: "This step takes the pointer you are using — it moves your cursor, clicks with it and brings that application forward — rather than letting an element act for itself. Auto, the grant this application already has and broad rules do not answer for you; approve it, or switch to full access. The pointer goes back where it was." },
  "chat.this_step_types_a_password": { zh: "这一步会把密码、一次性验证码或银行卡信息输入网站。自动放行、该站点已有的授权和宽泛规则都不能代你回答；要么批准，要么切到全部放行。", en: "This step types a password, a one-time code or card details into the site. Auto, the grant this site already has and broad rules do not answer for you; approve it, or switch to full access." },
